{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fleet Tycoon</strong> is a maritime logistics optimization game where every addictive 3-minute cycle brings surprising profit opportunities! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize Your Earnings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the cycle: explore, collect, trade, upgrade. Combine synergistic upgrades to create profit engines that break the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Competitive Optimization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate weekly leaderboards with your highest earnings, and everyone must &quot;kiss your ring&quot; to play! Or focus on beating your personal best at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-minute optimization cycles with endless depth </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated upgrade trees with synergistic game-changing keystones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly competitive leaderboards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple strategic paths: harvesting, trading, exploring, settlements, and more</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968620?t=1771207293","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968620/7d4ccad3dcffae0a134d7206b78d3ada39d64b09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771207293","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968620/be82062ae80b6570645e3aad48a35ffdba8e43a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771207293","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968620/be82062ae80b6570645e3aad48a35ffdba8e43a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771207293","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mous